    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/d245a09adb36f9af95a045dc83468160.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.poster.avif?t=1755007886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.webm?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.mp4?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The setting is modern Japan, Kanagawa Prefecture. The characters are all normal, life-sized students and working adults.\u00a0 A simulation RPG with a unique world view, where you fight with bikes and fists instead of swords and magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>It is also equipped with functions such as ``action rewind function'' and ``unit reinforcement during intermission.''  This is an authentic model that will satisfy SRPG fans!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/d8af79b9c5db2c17e97ed4c036297bfe.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.poster.avif?t=1755007886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.webm?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.mp4?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses a &quot;mixed turn system&quot; system in which battles take place at the same time as your own and enemy's turns, and the order of enemy and ally actions is mixed up.\u00a0 A new type of strategy that tests both your judgment to overcome the ever-changing war situation and your long-term strategic eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the order in which your allies act using the special command &quot;Shift Change.&quot; If you master this, you can completely change the course of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/bb1d1f0def84ca211c0ae8a178d76a23.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/5cc5084482f0dc735e8ff37e304d1401.avif?t=1755007886\" /></span>Many characters with various skills and unique actions appear! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your favorite character, utilize their individuality, and defeat powerful enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*31 characters will be playable in the early access version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/a28e238637d665bc9e3f9411dfd8dd59.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/dafaca74200cb4f5fd925b7c472511e5.avif?t=1755007886\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A three-part story depicting the fierce battle that took place over three years at Gyoun High School.\u00a0 Please enjoy this intense, momentary, and passionate drama about boys and girls.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The early access version includes the scenario of &quot;Part 1: Murakumo Alliance&quot; and &quot;Part 2: Blue Octave&quot;, which is 2/3 of the total. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About video distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may freely distribute the video of this work as long as it does not violate public order and morals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When posting or distributing, please include the URL of this store page in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/d245a09adb36f9af95a045dc83468160.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.poster.avif?t=1755007886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.webm?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.mp4?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The setting is modern Japan, Kanagawa Prefecture. The characters are all normal, life-sized students and working adults.\u00a0 A simulation RPG with a unique world view, where you fight with bikes and fists instead of swords and magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>It is also equipped with functions such as ``action rewind function'' and ``unit reinforcement during intermission.''  This is an authentic model that will satisfy SRPG fans!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/d8af79b9c5db2c17e97ed4c036297bfe.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.poster.avif?t=1755007886\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.webm?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.mp4?t=1755007886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses a &quot;mixed turn system&quot; system in which battles take place at the same time as your own and enemy's turns, and the order of enemy and ally actions is mixed up.\u00a0 A new type of strategy that tests both your judgment to overcome the ever-changing war situation and your long-term strategic eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the order in which your allies act using the special command &quot;Shift Change.&quot; If you master this, you can completely change the course of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/bb1d1f0def84ca211c0ae8a178d76a23.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/5cc5084482f0dc735e8ff37e304d1401.avif?t=1755007886\" /></span>Many characters with various skills and unique actions appear! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your favorite character, utilize their individuality, and defeat powerful enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*31 characters will be playable in the early access version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/a28e238637d665bc9e3f9411dfd8dd59.webp?t=1755007886\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/dafaca74200cb4f5fd925b7c472511e5.avif?t=1755007886\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A three-part story depicting the fierce battle that took place over three years at Gyoun High School.\u00a0 Please enjoy this intense, momentary, and passionate drama about boys and girls.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The early access version includes the scenario of &quot;Part 1: Murakumo Alliance&quot; and &quot;Part 2: Blue Octave&quot;, which is 2/3 of the total. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About video distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may freely distribute the video of this work as long as it does not violate public order and morals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When posting or distributing, please include the URL of this store page in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>",
